Example of using Fenix for online process recovery.
Generates an artificial failure to demonstrate recovery.

Basic               : A simple introduction to the concept. Generates an artificial
                      failure, which causes a switch over to the restart file that
                      continues from the checkpoint.
Run command         : mpirun lmp -spares 1 -in in.basic -restart-file in.basic.restart
in.basic            : The initial input file
                      Note: Uncomment the restart command to enable writing checkpoints
in.basic.restart    : The file to run after a failure
